{
  "title": "Contact Button & Lever",
  "category": "block",
  "description": "Contact Buttons & Contact Levers act like normal buttons / levers except that they are full blocks and they don't react to themselves but the block in front of them being right clicked. So if you place a block of stone in front of them and right click that stone they will react to that.\n\nThe block in front can be any block and only a right click with the main hand counts. A Contact Button gives a 20 tick (1 second) pulse, a Contact Lever switches on and off with every click. When powered they emit a signal of 15 on all sides.",
